1
00:00:01,700 --> 00:00:02,816
Before you were anyone,
在你成为任何人之前，

2
00:00:02,866 --> 00:00:05,266
you were a small light in the dark.
你只是黑暗里的一点微光。

3
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:07,250
Nobody asked you.
没有人问过你，

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:08,800
Nobody warned you.
也没有人提醒过你。

5
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:12,200
One morning, the world simply let you in.
某个清晨，世界就这样让你进来了。

6
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:16,533
At first, everything is enormous.
起初，一切都那么巨大。

7
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:18,250
A puddle is an ocean.
一个水坑就是一片海，

8
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:20,333
A butterfly is a miracle.
一只蝴蝶就是一个奇迹。

9
00:00:20,866 --> 00:00:23,550
You fall down a hundred times a day…
你一天摔倒一百次……

10
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:26,333
and every single time, you get back up.
可每一次，你都会爬起来。

11
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:28,450
No one has to teach you that.
没有人教你，

12
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:30,066
You just know.
你天生就会。

13
00:00:32,033 --> 00:00:33,150
Then they hand you a pencil,
后来，他们给你一支铅笔、

14
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:35,133
a desk, and a thousand questions.
一张课桌，还有一千个问题。

15
00:00:35,633 --> 00:00:37,500
You learn the answers.
你学会了答案。

16
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:40,300
But the questions you care about most…
可你最在乎的那些问题……

17
00:00:40,433 --> 00:00:41,880
no one can answer.
没有人能回答。

18
00:00:42,830 --> 00:00:43,450
Who am I?
我是谁？

19
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:44,383
Where am I going?
我要去哪里？

20
00:00:44,433 --> 00:00:46,100
Does any of this matter?
这一切有意义吗？

21
00:00:48,233 --> 00:00:50,816
And then, one ordinary afternoon,
然后，在某个平常的午后，

22
00:00:50,866 --> 00:00:52,700
someone looks back at you.
有人回头看了你一眼。

23
00:00:53,166 --> 00:00:55,266
Your heart forgets how to behave.
你的心忘了该怎么跳。

24
00:00:55,666 --> 00:00:57,750
You fall in love — clumsy,
你坠入爱河——笨拙、

25
00:00:57,800 --> 00:00:59,800
fast, and completely sure.
仓促，却无比笃定。

26
00:01:00,366 --> 00:01:03,400
For a while, the whole world is only two people wide.
有一阵子，整个世界只有两个人那么宽。

27
00:01:05,666 --> 00:01:08,533
Then the world hands you a hard hat and a heavy load.
后来，世界递给你一顶安全帽，和一副重担。

28
00:01:08,966 --> 00:01:10,583
Bills. Deadlines.
账单，截止日期，

29
00:01:10,633 --> 00:01:12,566
Promises you have to keep.
必须兑现的承诺。

30
00:01:13,033 --> 00:01:14,350
The days get shorter.
日子越来越短，

31
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:16,000
The worries get longer.
烦恼越来越长。

32
00:01:16,466 --> 00:01:18,583
You fail. You try again.
你失败了，再试一次，

33
00:01:18,633 --> 00:01:20,333
You fail a little better.
然后失败得好一点。

34
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:23,050
Some nights, you sit in the rain and wonder
有些夜里，你坐在雨里，想知道

35
00:01:23,100 --> 00:01:24,900
where your butterfly went.
你的那只蝴蝶去了哪里。

36
00:01:27,033 --> 00:01:30,200
And then, someone small reaches for your hand.
直到有一天，一只小小的手拉住了你。

37
00:01:31,033 --> 00:01:34,000
They look at the world the way you used to.
他们看世界的样子，就像当年的你。

38
00:01:34,366 --> 00:01:35,816
Every puddle an ocean.
每个水坑都是海，

39
00:01:35,866 --> 00:01:37,866
Every butterfly a miracle.
每只蝴蝶都是奇迹。

40
00:01:38,366 --> 00:01:40,150
And the weight feels lighter,
重担忽然变轻了，

41
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:42,900
because now you know what it was for.
因为你终于知道它是为了什么。

42
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:48,733
Time slows down… and somehow moves faster.
时间慢了下来……却又好像走得更快。

43
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:50,550
The hat gets softer.
帽子变软了，

44
00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:52,366
The steps get shorter.
脚步变小了。

45
00:01:52,966 --> 00:01:54,850
The people you love begin to leave,
你爱的人开始离开，

46
00:01:54,900 --> 00:01:57,200
like lights rising into the sky.
像一盏盏灯，升上了天空。

47
00:01:58,166 --> 00:02:00,666
You don't carry as much anymore.
你不再背负那么多了。

48
00:02:00,833 --> 00:02:02,533
You don't need to.
也不再需要了。

49
00:02:02,966 --> 00:02:04,950
You sit where you once danced, and watch
你坐在曾经跳舞的地方，

50
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:07,133
someone else chase the butterfly.
看着别人去追那只蝴蝶。

51
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:12,500
In the end, a life isn't measured in years.
最后，人的一生不是用年岁来衡量的。

52
00:02:13,166 --> 00:02:14,950
It's measured in puddles and pencils,
而是用水坑和铅笔，

53
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:17,300
in hands held and loads carried…
用牵过的手和扛过的重担……

54
00:02:17,633 --> 00:02:20,333
in the moments you were truly there.
用那些你真正活过的瞬间。

55
00:02:21,433 --> 00:02:23,533
So close your eyes, gently.
所以，轻轻闭上眼吧。

56
00:02:25,066 --> 00:02:28,266
Somewhere, a small light is waking up.
在某个地方，一点微光正在醒来。

57
00:02:28,633 --> 00:02:31,500
And a new morning is just beginning.
新的清晨，正要开始。

